Phase 1: Theoretical Foundation & Base Taxonomy Derivation
* Understand each subcategory defined in the ***Taxonomy Guidelines*** and ensure that the coding is carried out in accordance with the unified rules.
Phase 2: Alphanumeric Mapping & Code-String Synthesis
